      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i really hate going to the er, it's so expensive and i have so much work to do. it's probably just a minor bump, right? if i just take some ibuprofen and stay in a dark room for a few hours, i'll be fine to go back to my computer later? i just need to know i'm not gonna be in trouble for just taking something for the pain.",
